26-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"}],"image":{"id":4465248,"path":"https://res-4.cloudinary.com/bookingsync/image/upload/c_fill,f_auto,fl_progressive,g_center,h_1600,q_auto,w_2400/v1733648767/4znq_cacaa62f-7727-499f-a183-80f04c37abd3.jpg?_a=BACMTiGT","position":1,"rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:10:56.000000Z"},"reviews":[{"id":5550500,"review":"Everything was perfect","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:01.000000Z"},{"id":5590186,"review":"Great location, and great hosts. Xuru stays is always  on point with their listings.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:06.000000Z"},{"id":5603684,"review":"The apartment is exceptionally clean and beautifully designed—definitely a step above most rentals you’ll find in El Gouna. Everything feels new, modern, and thoughtfully put together.\n\nA couple of things to be aware of: while the location is great in terms of beach access, reaching the main road or getting into town can be a bit inconvenient. It requires a long walk to catch a tuk-tuk or taxi, so keep that in mind if you plan to move around frequently.\n\nAlso, a small note about the bedding: the bedroom comes with four pillows, all of which are quite large and firm. If you prefer soft pillows, you might want to bring your own for a more comfortable sleep.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:10.000000Z"},{"id":5639137,"review":"⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️⭐️ Absolutely Perfect Stay!\nI had a wonderful time during my stay in Guna. The place was spotless — incredibly clean and well-maintained. It truly felt like a 5-star experience! The apartment had everything I needed, from amenities to little thoughtful touches that made it feel like home. The location was also perfect with easy access to everything. I couldn’t have asked for a better stay. Highly recommended and would definitely come back again!","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5644407,"review":"🙏🙏♥️","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:14.000000Z"},{"id":5658127,"review":"Spectacular experience \nWouldn’t hesitate to repeat","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5662500,"review":"Great place to stay in","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:17.000000Z"},{"id":5669534,"review":"Recommended","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:19.000000Z"},{"id":5764989,"review":"Every thing was good and smooth,","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:31.000000Z"},{"id":5770350,"review":"Positive:\nPosizione ottima\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5771756,"review":"Immer wieder","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:32.000000Z"},{"id":5774641,"review":"Positive:\nHost very responsive and friendly. Check in was super smooth. The flats location is a 2min walk from the beach which is very rare in Gouna. Definitely coming again.\n\nNegative:\nNothing major at all, but the kitchen is barely equipped with anything.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5777046,"review":"The place was very nice and clean, with spacious a bathroom. It was incredibly close to the beach , just a one-minute walk!\n\nThe host was extremely responsive and even checked in with us a couple of times during our stay to make sure everything was going well and to see if we needed anything.\n\nThe apartment has two terrace balconies, which was a lovely bonus.\n\nThe only downside was that, due to nearby construction, it was a bit difficult to access the property. We had to walk a fair distance from the car, and there was a bit of confusion during checkout, but the host handled it all very helpfully and professionally.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:35.000000Z"},{"id":5822398,"review":"Great stay and even better support!","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:43.000000Z"},{"id":5846548,"review":"I would like to thank Xuru stays and Hadeer for the outstanding experience been provided by them and the whole team. \n\nI  enjoyed the stay and really appreciate all efforts introduced during our vacation.\n\nApartments were super clean, tidy and cozy, close follow up by Hadeer and maintenance team makes our stay more convenient and enjoyable.\n\nThank you all 🙏","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:45.000000Z"},{"id":5858612,"review":"perfect, will be back.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:51.000000Z"},{"id":5880177,"review":"Positive:\nloved my stay very much,was excellent\n\nNegative:\nfar from parking and there is no golf car for luggage","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5884514,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:23:55.000000Z"},{"id":5907222,"review":"Pretty nice place","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:01.000000Z"},{"id":5916301,"review":"good experience, location is very close to beach but also away from parking","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:04.000000Z"},{"id":5921532,"review":"Positive:\nNo comment\n\nNegative:\nNo comment","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5921656,"review":"Everything was perfect really enjoyed my time there!","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:06.000000Z"},{"id":5938390,"review":"We liked the ball","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:10.000000Z"},{"id":6023944,"review":"Great location, walking distance to the beach and supermarket. The place was clean, fully equipped, and had everything we needed. Would definitely stay again.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:17.000000Z"},{"id":6076690,"review":"Positive:\nEverything was perfect!! You can see the beach when you get out literally. The apartment is very nice and clean\n\nNegative:\nThe parking is a bit far and its not easy when you have a family so put that on your mind","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:20.000000Z"},{"id":6093101,"review":"Sehr schöne Lage, nahe am Strand und zum Pool. Ruhige Gegend, sehr sicher, komfortabel","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:24.000000Z"},{"id":6109228,"review":"It was very nice, the host was helpful but it was quite expensive for 1 BR","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:28.000000Z"},{"id":6129964,"review":"Great place, very close to the beach and pool. The living room and balcony are really nice. Great amenities. We had a great time and this was our second time staying with the same host, very responsive and flexible.","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:30.000000Z"},{"id":6164527,"review":"Positive:\nClose to beach and the pool\n\nNegative:\nNext to a lot of construction work and has a long way from the parking","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"},{"id":6167774,"review":"Really enjoyed my stay","rental_id":232838,"created_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z","updated_at":"2026-08-12T22:24:40.000000Z"}],"amenities":[]}